# Mark machine-generated artifacts so:
#   * GitHub's PR diff view collapses them by default ("File suppressed
#     by .gitattributes" / Linguist treats them as generated and excludes
#     them from language stats).
#   * Code-review automations (parallel_validation, CodeQL, etc.) that
#     honour `linguist-generated` skip them when computing diffs — large
#     auto-generated batches (e.g. an 871-file `npm run render-grid`
#     refresh) don't time those tools out.
#
# These files are NOT third-party vendored code, they are produced by
# scripts in this repo (`scripts/render-grid.js`, `scripts/screenshot.js`).
# Edit the source helpers under src/js/helpers/ — never edit the
# fixtures by hand.
fixtures/grid/**         linguist-generated=true
fixtures/grid/_index.json linguist-generated=true
fixtures/screenshots/**  linguist-generated=true binary
